  "content": "\n\n![Benched](https://i.imgur.com/h0bSBTU.png)  \n\n**Benched** 新增了獨特的**野餐長椅**！這些野餐長椅佔據 2x2 的空間，您只需右鍵點擊即可直接坐上去！\n\n![Separator](https://imgur.com/9Xh8KmD.png)\n\n### 內容：\n\n#### <img width='30' src='https://imgur.com/o557rZJ.png' alt='金合歡野餐長椅'> 金合歡野餐長椅\n<details>\n<summary>合成配方</summary>\n<img width='310' src='https://imgur.com/s3DdOvG.png' alt='金合歡野餐長椅的合成配方'>\n</details>\n\n#### <img width='30' src='https://imgur.com/4cA25LP.png' alt='白樺野餐長椅'> 白樺野餐長椅\n<details>\n<summary>合成配方</summary>\n<img width='310' src='https://imgur.com/bSC2YjD.png' alt='白樺野餐長椅的合成配方'>\n</details>\n\n#### <img width='30' src='https://imgur.com/kNCPjEM.png' alt='深色橡木野餐長椅'> 深色橡木野餐長椅\n<details>\n<summary>合成配方</summary>\n<img width='310' src='https://imgur.com/zP1KfN1.png' alt='深色橡木野餐長椅的合成配方'>\n</details>\n\n#### <img width='30' src='https://imgur.com/hpNnXpB.png' alt='叢林野餐長椅'> 叢林野餐長椅\n<details>\n<summary>合成配方</summary>\n<img width='310' src='https://imgur.com/dkZGlNO.png' alt='叢林野餐長椅的合成配方'>\n</details>\n\n#### <img width='30' src='https://imgur.com/Z8nD3UF.png' alt='橡木野餐長椅'> 橡木野餐長椅\n<details>\n<summary>合成配方</summary>\n<img width='310' src='https://imgur.com/CS2Tf4o.png' alt='橡木野餐長椅的合成配方'>\n</details>\n\n#### <img width='30' src='https://imgur.com/lR5h4bF.png' alt='雲杉野餐長椅'> 雲杉野餐長椅\n<details>\n<summary>合成配方</summary>\n<img width='310' src='https://imgur.com/NeOEwLN.png' alt='雲杉野餐長椅的合成配方'>\n</details>\n\n#### <img width='30' src='https://imgur.com/TccrptN.png' alt='深紅野餐長椅'> 深紅野餐長椅\n<details>\n<summary>合成配方</summary>\n<img width='310' src='https://imgur.com/0d6gr6F.png' alt='深紅野餐長椅的合成配方'>\n</details>\n\n#### <img width='30' src='https://imgur.com/Q3GdQ67.png' alt='扭曲野餐長椅'> 扭曲野餐長椅\n<details>\n<summary>合成配方</summary>\n<img width='310' src='https://imgur.com/avY6zJX.png' alt='扭曲野餐長椅的合成配方'>\n</details>\n\n![Separator](https://imgur.com/9Xh8KmD.png)\n\n### 常見問題\n**我可以將你的模組加入我的模組包中嗎？**  \n可以，歡迎在您的模組包中使用我的模組。  \n**可以在長椅上坐下嗎？**  \n可以，只需右鍵點擊長椅即可坐下。\n\n![Separator](https://imgur.com/9Xh8KmD.png)\n\n### Discord\n想要了解未來內容、即將推出的模組以及進行討論，歡迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 伺服器！  \n[<img width='400' src='https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png'>](https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e)\n\n![Separator](https://imgur.com/9Xh8KmD.png)\n\n<img width='266' src='https://imgur.com/bA5x3eg.png' alt='野餐長椅'>",
